# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Linux CI runs (CLAUDE.md §9).
# The Vulkan loader and lavapipe (Mesa's LLVM-based software Vulkan driver)
# keep process-lifetime state that LeakSanitizer reports at exit; none of it
# is Nepheline's. The engine's own allocations are never suppressed.
leak:libvulkan.so
leak:libvulkan_lvp
leak:libLLVM
leak:libdrm
leak:libgallium
